The math is brutal: Rural hospitals lose $70B from Trump’s tax cuts, while his token $50B “rescue” covers <50% of losses. Michigan faces $6B in cuts; PA rural providers already bleed 26¢ per Medicaid dollar. This isn’t fiscal prudence—it’s systemic sabotage of communities Trump vowed to protect.  

Accountability starts with exposing how GOP enablers let Trump trade rural lives for donor handouts. The admin’s chaos has a body count—and voters won’t forget.

